{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "pic-event:sourcing.award.offer_expiry_overridden",
  "title": "sourcing.award.offer_expiry_overridden",
  "description": "Payload (outbox_event.payload) of sourcing.award.offer_expiry_overridden on SOURCING_EVENT. Produced by services/sourcing.py. An award was proposed on a bid whose offer validity had ended: the block (409 BID_OFFER_EXPIRED, D5) was lifted by the written override of a user allowed by SOURCING-POLICY.expiredOfferOverride; the award decision carries it as exception BID_OFFER_EXPIRED.",
